1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,242
Copper is the oldest worked metal: the repousse work of the Kathmandu valley and the gilded roofs of Pashupatinath.

2
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:11,914
Its chief ore is copper pyrite, copper iron sulphide.

3
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:19,101
Other ores are copper glance, cuprite, and the green and blue carbonates malachite and azurite.

